{"unit_id":"Practice019__dsh-kun-pet#feature-1","repo":"Practice019/dsh-kun-pet","commit":"ea132ae9d8bcba62946fc69f3faa170c2b0446e1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Kun Like 桌宠的功能「Agent 状态动画」：根据 Agent 与工具活动显示空闲、工作、思考、等待、失败和完成动画，并用气泡提示当前状态。状态通过 Host 接口同步到 Web 组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:132-185","lib/index.js:192-277","lib/client.js:84-125"]}
