{"unit_id":"Practice019__dsh-kun-pet#feature-3","repo":"Practice019/dsh-kun-pet","commit":"ea132ae9d8bcba62946fc69f3faa170c2b0446e1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Kun Like 桌宠的功能「Agent 状态与资源接口」：Host 注册状态 JSON、精灵图和语音资源路由，浏览器定期读取状态并更新显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:51-90","lib/client.js:84-104"]}
{"unit_id":"Practice019__dsh-kun-pet#feature-4","repo":"Practice019/dsh-kun-pet","commit":"ea132ae9d8bcba62946fc69f3faa170c2b0446e1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Kun Like 桌宠的功能「回合声音提示」：Agent 停止输出时由 Host 调用 PowerShell 播放本地语音；提问工具触发时也会提示，并避免同一回合重复播放。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:92-100","lib/index.js:215-225","lib/index.js:244-268"]}
