{"unit_id":"Practice019__dsh-kun-pet#caveat-2","repo":"Practice019/dsh-kun-pet","commit":"ea132ae9d8bcba62946fc69f3faa170c2b0446e1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Kun Like 桌宠通过 DSH 本机 webServer 提供状态、精灵图和语音路由，浏览器组件轮询本地接口同步状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-90","lib/client.js:84-103"]}
